WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.920
January 8th 21:04 Kobe Mountains

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:26.810
Hate Fiend  Audium

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.540
Asuka Tennoji

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.520
Sword Sniper  Rigel

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.520
Azumi Kagamihara

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:14.150
I can't believe it defeated Type II so easily.

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:25.810
The Proud  Fierte

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:30.420
Nine Worthies  Alexander

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:30.420
You blocked my attack easily.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:37.300
You are truly a worthy foe, Audium!

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:42.850
It's useless!

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.950
Katana Samurai  Rindo                    Chitose Aoba

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:00.950
Did he get it?

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:04.810
This one won't die that easily!

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:07.820
Let's go too!

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:08.640
Yes.

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:25.720
Ayase Kamiyugi

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:25.720
Black Blade  Sieger

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:25.720
Hey, what's going on here?

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:27.970
Just what it looks like.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:33.960
Even Audium was no match for Alexander.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.530
If you must blame someone,

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:40.350
blame your own weakness.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.910
No...

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.260
Aina?

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:12.160
Aina Mikage

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.650
What? How did I get here?

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.230
What's going on?

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:24.910
I don't know.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.550
Tennoji... Ayase...

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.800
Hey, what is this place?

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:34.400
What are we doing here?

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:38.630
Um, my work shift ended, and then...

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:40.920
Huh?

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.730
What happened then?

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:43.990
Huh?

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.930
This is strange...

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.350
I...

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.620
It was me.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.900
I did all of that!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.760
I tried to kill Tennoji.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:07.640
I tried to kill Ayase.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.170
I tried to kill everyone!

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.790
Calm down, Aina.

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.290
Tennoji...

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.790
No! No!

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:20.410
I don't want this...

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.050
I don't want this!

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:28.800
No!

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:30.800
Aina!

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.070
Get back, Ayase!

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:34.550
Asuka!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.820
No...

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:38.810
Aina is...

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.320
Get a hold of yourself, Asuka Tennoji.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.580
Audium was actually Aina.

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:11.470
So the truth of the matter
was something so absurd?

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.480
Mikado Kurosaki

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.970
Sera Kurashiki

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:27.850
Everyone!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.990
Tell me the situation.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:38.170
It was... Audium was Aina.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:43.350
Aina? Who is that?

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:45.000
My friend!

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:49.990
January 8th 22:10 Inside Audium

00:06:56.010 --> 00:06:57.970
She's suffering.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:12.950
What is she doing?

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.530
How should I know?

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.790
She's looking for Z/X.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:18.540
Are you sure?

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.320
Yes.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:23.280
I can sense an incredible hatred for Z/X.

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:27.240
Audium is the Hate Fiend, after all.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:31.180
But at the same time, she's really scared.

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:35.180
It's no fun if she loses her nerve now!

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:35.180
Twelve Apostles, Aquarius  Gambiel

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:35.180
Cait Sith  Coon

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:38.950
What do you mean, Gambiel?

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:42.560
Audium was trying to use a human's hatred

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:48.570
to become a being that could 
destroy all living things through hate.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:52.740
But this Aina girl was far too weak.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:56.650
She couldn't withstand the hatred 
Audium required to continue growing.

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:58.550
Her mind was worn down,

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:01.110
and she lost herself completely.

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:03.000
And that's the result.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:07.120
No...

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.090
Aina was too kind.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.290
So kind, she couldn't even truly hate

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:12.890
her parents' killers.

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:25.730
It's still not even fazing her?

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.020
Ayase!

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:33.280
Ayase!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.840
Ayase! Ayase!

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:14.910
Where are we?

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:22.270
What is this?

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.870
I think they're Aina's memories.

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:28.630
<i>Good morning, Mom, Dad!</i>

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:32.540
<i>I made a new friend!</i>

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:38.670
That's me...

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:45.640
Me, too?

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.670
<i>That's right. Everyone here is your friend!</i>

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:52.320
<i>I'm a Z/X user.</i>

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.940
<i>You were all hiding this from me?</i>

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:58.410
No, that's not true!

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:03.410
<i>It was the Z/X that took everything from me.</i>

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:06.300
Aina, don't!

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.490
Don't take that mask!

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.190
Aina!

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:11.170
Aina!

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:16.670
It's our...

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.480
It's our fault.

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:22.220
That's right.

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:24.450
Sinister Fiend  Malice

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:23.840
You're...

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:25.360
You're alive?

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:30.220
No, you all thoroughly killed me.

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:34.690
Right now, I'm nothing 
but a remnant of a memory.

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:42.470
Listen to the voice of your 
heart, Ayase Kamiyugi.

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:45.110
The cold, black darkness within you

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:49.430
is what will become the core 
of the next Audium.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:00.720
This is...

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:02.710
Ayase's...?

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:05.890
Ayase!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:09.780
I don't have any cold, black darkness!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:12.030
Say whatever you want.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:16.600
What I want to hear isn't 
the words from your lips.

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:20.890
It's the screams wrung from 
the depths of your heart.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.460
Ayase!

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.340
Asuka!

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:28.510
Stretch out your hand, Ayase!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.260
Asuka!

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.830
Ayase!

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.020
Asuka!

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:56.100
Asuka! Asuka!

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:58.570
Wake up, Asuka!

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.710
Fierte?

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:02.780
Asuka!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:05.640
Sera! Where are Ayase and Aina?

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:36.420
January 9th 03:05 Defense Force Front Line Command Post

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:45.720
We were unable to pierce the 
aura of light around Audium,

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:47.780
even with Alexander's spear.

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.540
From what Asuka Tennoji said,

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:58.790
Audium intends to use Ayase Kamiyugi 
to evolve into a new form.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:02.770
You might say it's like the 
cocoon of a butterfly.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.320
I can't wait.

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:10.430
The next time Audium wakes up,

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:12.820
I'm sure she'll be a horrible monster

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:16.230
that lays waste to everything in sight.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:19.940
Wouldn't that put the 
White World in danger, too?

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.600
That would be pretty fun, too.

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:27.630
Then we have to do something fast.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:31.130
But if even Alexander can't hurt it,

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.350
there's nothing we can do.

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:35.460
I have a plan.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.960
We let her emerge from her cocoon.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:40.340
What?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.340
No matter how hard the shell is,

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:47.090
she has to break it to get out.

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:51.070
January 9th 03:11 Kobe City

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:52.680
I'm getting together all the forces I can.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:57.620
January 9th 03:12 Kobe Outskirts

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:05.030
Of course, Alexander, you will help as well.

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:06.780
Very well.

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:08.970
The instant she emerges,

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:12.170
we concentrate all the firepower we have

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:15.040
on a single point to eliminate Audium.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:19.080
No! Ayase and Aina are inside that thing.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:20.580
How naïve.

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:24.940
Weren't you going to protect Kobe?

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:26.630
Are you going to put

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:30.610
tens of thousands of people 
in danger for the sake of two?

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:33.100
Don't lose sight of the big 
picture for something small.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.390
There's no big or small when 
people's lives are concerned!

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:39.010
Everybody's life is equally important.

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:41.350
Don't throw your puerile ideals at me.

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:42.880
It's not an ideal!

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:43.980
It's how I feel!

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:46.740
You have someone you don't 
want to lose too, don't you?

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:54.900
I don't want to lose anything else.

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:58.250
So I'll save Ayase and Aina,

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.190
and I'll protect Kobe!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.380
You managed to silence 
my strategist. Impressive.

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:12.640
Mikado, you have lost.

00:15:13.110 --> 00:15:14.260
What?

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:17.200
Alexander's right.

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.440
I'm going with Asuka here.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:22.570
I guess I just don't see 
things your way after all.

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.270
Thank you for everything.

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:26.650
We're going, too.

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:29.180
We owe you.

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:30.680
You fools...

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:32.150
Please, Mikado!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:35.230
Give us a little time.

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:37.910
Asuka and Ayase are both my friends!

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.550
Mikado...

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:51.950
Ten minutes. I won't wait any longer.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.300
Thank you!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:16:00.070
Hey. Looks like you've settled things.

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:02.560
Sieger, are you okay?

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:06.550
Please. I can make it a few days without Ayase.

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:07.570
I see.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:11.690
But that's assuming I stay put.

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:13.450
I'm going with you.

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.320
But if you do that...

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:19.580
Yeah, I'll run out of resources fast, I'm sure.

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:23.830
So give me resources, kid.

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:25.280
What?

00:16:25.280 --> 00:16:28.010
If I do that, Fierte will...

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:30.830
Ignition Overdrive.

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:32.590
What's that?

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.680
I've heard of it.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:41.600
It's a way for a single card device 
to supply resources to two Z/X.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.550
Really?

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:49.290
It's only possible if you've got the talent, kid.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:52.860
And if I fail?

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.270
No idea.

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:57.620
I've never tried it, or seen it.

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:01.120
There's no way to tell what'll happen.

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:06.040
So I won't force you.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.380
You decide.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:14.380
I'll try it.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.150
You sure?

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:17.980
If that's Asuka's decision,

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.390
I'll obey it.

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.140
I see.

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:22.900
Thanks.

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.780
Ignition Overdrive!

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:45.820
So this is the power of Ignition Overdrive.

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:49.290
I can feel the power rising in me!

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:00.040
You did it, kid.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.450
Asuka!

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:07.060
Are you okay, Asuka?

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:10.060
Wake up, Asuka, please!

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:15.320
Two at once is really tough.

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:17.370
Asuka...

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.620
If you want to call it off, now's the time.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.070
No way!

00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:25.560
I've decided that I'm going to 
protect both of them, and Kobe!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.730
Sounds good, kid.

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.590
January 9th 03:30 Kobe Mountains

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:41.350
Ayase...

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:44.470
Ayase! Ayase!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.860
No!

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:58.610
Don't go to Ayase!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.020
I was scared.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:07.900
So the mask took advantage 
of my weakness to control me.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:10.750
Even though I didn't want to hurt anyone...

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:17.270
Ayase, don't you end up like me.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.520
There is darkness in everyone's heart.

00:19:20.520 --> 00:19:23.770
But there's light, too.

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:26.470
When the darkness is 
about to overcome you,

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:32.680
turn around, and you'll see someone 
you care about standing there.

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:35.340
Aina...

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.350
Stop!

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:45.200
It's all my fault!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.410
Leave Ayase out of this!

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:52.460
I'll be your monster!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:54.350
Don't get cocky.

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:56.880
I have no need for you any longer.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:00.680
Ayase!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.430
It's not Ayase?

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.430
Aina! Aina!

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.160
Aina, wake up!

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:21.440
Tennoji...

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.140
Save her.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.800
Save Ayase!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.510
Now, Ayase Kamiyugi...

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:36.360
Listen to the voice of your heart.

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:40.630
You'll hear the song of hatred 
like the roar of the waves.

00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:48.720
Run away, everyone.

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:54.750
January 9th 03:42 Kobe Mountains

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.000
So it's begun.

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:31.640
Audium Final Form

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:48.320
Akashi Kaikyo Bridge

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:50.280
Kagoshima Mountains

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:52.930
Izu Ooshima Offshore

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:57.810
What power!

00:21:58.940 --> 00:22:01.790
Is she really trying to destroy the world?

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:10.050
This is so much fun!

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:43.950
Next time on <i>Z/X Ignition</i>:

00:23:43.330 --> 00:23:55.750
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:46.170
End Phase.

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:52.330
What color is the future they will build?
